                        "sense_id": "f2867db4-a01b-36e7-9f8f-237915029ea0",
                        "entry_id": "3f20c964-a8da-3a65-82dd-1de3dd18ff66",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Not having gone stale; fresh."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a2ab173e-e214-409e-adc1-852f904a870c",
                                "sense_id": "f2867db4-a01b-36e7-9f8f-237915029ea0",
                                "text": "But the sagas have another quality which they share only with a few of the great literary masterpieces of the world : the quality of vivid, unstaled and undauntable life."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f7530463-551a-4cdb-8700-6e44499dbd5d",
                                "sense_id": "f2867db4-a01b-36e7-9f8f-237915029ea0",
                                "text": "If you are a busy lawyer without any outside ambitions you spend your days using one bit of your mind, and the rest remains comparatively young and unstaled."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c438c803-9bde-4f58-8c05-8c97285efe97",
                                "sense_id": "f2867db4-a01b-36e7-9f8f-237915029ea0",
                                "text": "But her heart was so so generous, her range of acquaintance so wide and her delight in human relationships so unstaled, that she could have spent a national income without difficulty."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "91a0987d-39ff-4825-b951-6ee96fa240cf",
                                "sense_id": "f2867db4-a01b-36e7-9f8f-237915029ea0",
                                "text": "Burns' language is imbued with a momentum of its own that induces laughter and exhilaration – an effect unstaled by familiarity."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
